<div class="container-fluid px-3" style="padding-top: 90px;">

    <% content_for :dropdown_menu do %>
        <%= link_to "Index page", root_path, class: "dropdown-item" %>
        <a class="dropdown-item" href="#">Another action</a>
        <div class="dropdown-divider"></div>
        <a class="dropdown-item" href="#">Something else here</a>
    <% end %>

    <div class="gradient-text-container mb-4 text-start">
        <h1 class="gradient-text">This page is all about me</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-4">
        <p>
            At first I wasn't really sure what to include on this page but I decided to have some fun with the heading and then try to use some pictures to describe
            the main parts of my life. This was an interesting choice considering I rarely take pictures so I used google to help with that part.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Soccer -->
    <div class="d-flex mb-5">
        <div class="me-3">
            <%= image_tag "ball.jpg", width: 50, height: 50, alt: "Generic soccer ball image" %>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h5>Soccer</h5>

            <p>
                As you probably could have guessed from the page titled "Soccer", soccer is a huge part of my life.
                I have been playing since I was little, I joined my first organized team when I was 7 and I never stopped.
                In addition to always playing, I am also always watching games whenever I can.
            </p>

            <div class="d-flex mt-3 ms-4">
                <div class="me-3">
                    <%= image_tag "mnu.jpg", width: 50, height: 50, alt: "Manchester United logo" %>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h5>Manchester United</h5>

                    <p>
                        My favorite team is a team from England called Manchester United.
                        I chose them as my favorite because when I picked my favorite player,
                        that was the team he played for.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- School -->
    <div class="d-flex mb-5">
        <div class="me-3">
            <%= image_tag "student.jpg", width: 50, height: 50, alt: "Student image" %>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h5>School</h5>

            <p>
                School is also very important to me. I enjoy learning and am currently double majoring
                in neuroscience and computer science.
            </p>

            <div class="d-flex mt-3 ms-4">
                <div class="me-3">
                    <%= image_tag "brain.jpg", width: 50, height: 50, alt: "Brain image" %>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h5>Neuroscience</h5>

                    <p>
                        In high school I took AP Psychology and a neuroscience elective at the same time
                        and I found the brain really interesting during that time.
                        During my first two years of college I took the first few biology and chemistry classes
                        and the combination of these lead me back to the brain.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="d-flex mt-3 ms-4">
                <div class="me-3">
                    <%= image_tag "cs.jpg", width: 50, height: 50, alt: "Computer science image" %>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h5>Computer Science</h5>

                    <p>
                        I had been told to start coding and try computer science by many people for many years
                        and I just never started. Then, last spring, I needed to take my ConnCourse requirement
                        and COM 110 was a class that fulfilled that requirement so I figured I would try it.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Reading -->
    <div class="d-flex mb-5">
        <div class="me-3">
            <%= image_tag "book.jpg", width: 50, height: 50, alt: "Book image" %>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h5>Reading</h5>

            <p>
                On the rare occasion I have some free time, I will likely be reading.
                When I was younger I had a lot more time and I was always reading.
                I read anything and everything I could get my hands on.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>